1
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:22,510
How much farther

2
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:25,280
until we reach the end of this path?

3
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,840
We'll never get to the end

4
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,400
until the Sect Master is dead.

5
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:32,960
The Sect Master is a cunning man.

6
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:35,390
When you meet him,
whether you will die or survive

7
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:36,850
depends half on heaven...

8
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:38,120
And half

9
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:41,090
on myself.

10
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:43,320
The Diamond Sutra says,

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:44,670
"no mark of self,

12
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:45,430
no mark of others,

13
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,890
no mark of living beings."

14
00:00:47,750 --> 00:00:48,880
Make sure you decide

15
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,140
how you are going to

16
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:51,850
face the Sect Master.

17
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:59,190
[A Prophet]

18
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:02,100
[Episode 10]

19
00:03:18,290 --> 00:03:20,140
Who exactly are you?

20
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:26,320
I am...

21
00:03:27,910 --> 00:03:29,910
Shangguan Chengming.

22
00:03:30,670 --> 00:03:32,230
Who gave you this name?

23
00:03:33,110 --> 00:03:34,040
My...

24
00:03:36,250 --> 00:03:37,180
My mother.

25
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,030
Mom...

26
00:03:45,329 --> 00:03:47,010
I'm in so much pain.

27
00:03:51,470 --> 00:03:52,660
It hurts badly.

28
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:59,079
Any disciples in Tianxiang Sect

29
00:03:58,980 --> 00:04:02,640
[Eight years ago]

30
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:02,000
who leave without permission

31
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:04,350
shall be hunted down by the others.

32
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,550
Right, Junior?

33
00:04:07,830 --> 00:04:09,230
I can guarantee

34
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,350
that after the two of you leave,

35
00:04:11,350 --> 00:04:13,880
your whereabouts won't be known to anyone.

36
00:04:16,990 --> 00:04:18,870
You've been gone for many years.

37
00:04:17,269 --> 00:04:18,790
[Shangguan Hong]

38
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,720
Why did you come back?

39
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:22,610
Stop what you're doing.

40
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:24,190
Go with me.

41
00:04:24,350 --> 00:04:25,480
Leave here for good.

42
00:04:28,870 --> 00:04:30,270
There are rules in place.

43
00:04:38,670 --> 00:04:39,790
Zhang Dancheng,

44
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:41,800
you've really gone every length

45
00:04:42,130 --> 00:04:44,930
to take my position.

46
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,750
You feel better now?

47
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:45,720
Sir.

48
00:05:47,470 --> 00:05:48,430
The...

49
00:05:48,930 --> 00:05:50,590
the bleeding just won't stop.

50
00:05:59,080 --> 00:05:59,790
Sir.

51
00:06:00,350 --> 00:06:01,040
Sir!

52
00:06:03,860 --> 00:06:05,250
She told me

53
00:06:05,910 --> 00:06:07,510
that a stab wound in that spot

54
00:06:08,030 --> 00:06:09,790
wouldn't cause death,

55
00:06:09,990 --> 00:06:11,600
and that she could be saved.

56
00:06:11,620 --> 00:06:13,350
She's already dead, sir.

57
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:42,870
Sir.

58
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:24,990
Sir,

59
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,640
have some tea.

60
00:08:35,830 --> 00:08:36,400
Sit down.

61
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,040
What was on your mind, sir?

62
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,240
How do you think

63
00:08:53,430 --> 00:08:55,690
Zhang Dancheng managed to find this boy?

64
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:56,890
Back then,

65
00:08:57,350 --> 00:08:59,410
I went to the village where Hong lived

66
00:08:59,710 --> 00:09:00,830
and asked many villagers.

67
00:09:00,830 --> 00:09:03,430
They said Hong did have a child

68
00:09:03,670 --> 00:09:05,040
who was studying away from home,

69
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:06,760
but nobody ever actually saw him.

70
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:08,430
Zhang Dancheng made me

71
00:09:08,830 --> 00:09:11,400
kill the woman I loved most
with my own hands.

72
00:09:11,550 --> 00:09:12,240
Now,

73
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:14,310
he has my own son

74
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:16,230
bear the name of Wang Jiaxian

75
00:09:16,250 --> 00:09:19,110
and come seek revenge against me
in Tianxiang Sect.

76
00:09:22,950 --> 00:09:24,920
He is trying to trick me

77
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:27,670
into killing my own son.

78
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,550
That's really

79
00:09:30,710 --> 00:09:32,550
a dirty trick.

80
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,430
It's not dirty,

81
00:09:35,670 --> 00:09:36,920
but vicious!

82
00:09:39,310 --> 00:09:41,240
It takes several steps to kill him.

83
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:43,390
It's hard for you to find him,

84
00:09:43,590 --> 00:09:45,520
but it's easy the other way around.

85
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,550
What should I do when I see him?

86
00:09:48,550 --> 00:09:50,210
Just remember two sentences.

87
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,190
The first one:

88
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,400
A deadly blood feud.

89
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:56,870
Under no circumstances
shall I change my name.

90
00:09:56,870 --> 00:09:59,670
All my family members were killed
by Tianxiang Sect.

91
00:09:59,670 --> 00:10:01,470
Today, I failed to take revenge.

92
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:04,040
I only regret that I can't kill you
with my own hands.

93
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:06,320
I found Wang Jiaxian's grave.

94
00:10:06,790 --> 00:10:08,190
I dug it up

95
00:10:08,540 --> 00:10:09,830
and saw bones inside.

96
00:10:09,950 --> 00:10:11,880
If you are Wang Jiaxian,

97
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,450
then whose bones are those?

98
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:15,160
What's the second sentence?

99
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,280
It's as follows:

100
00:10:17,850 --> 00:10:19,360
Shangguan Chengming.

101
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:28,400
This acupuncture technique
will paralyze your whole body,

102
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,450
loosen your mind,

103
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,320
and make you speak the truth.

104
00:10:32,030 --> 00:10:33,280
Maybe one day,

105
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,000
the Sect Master's Chief Batou,

106
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Qin Baichuan,

107
00:10:36,470 --> 00:10:37,400
will torture you

108
00:10:37,590 --> 00:10:39,240
with needles.

109
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:51,380
When you feel like your soul has gone,

110
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:55,630
everything will be left to chance.

111
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,550
Who exactly are you?

112
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:11,520
I am...

113
00:11:13,550 --> 00:11:15,640
Shangguan Chengming.

114
00:11:28,190 --> 00:11:28,990
You're awake.

115
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:31,820
What's this place?

116
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:32,310
This is

117
00:11:32,590 --> 00:11:33,650
where gofers live.

118
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:34,450
Here,

119
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:35,780
have some water first.

120
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:37,950
The Sect Master told me

121
00:11:37,950 --> 00:11:39,280
to take good care of you.

122
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,590
See, how generous of the Sect Master.

123
00:11:41,590 --> 00:11:42,760
You attempted to kill him,

124
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,490
yet he still treats you so well.

125
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:48,180
The Sect Master is done locking me up?

126
00:11:48,590 --> 00:11:49,920
Let's grab a bite first.

127
00:11:50,160 --> 00:11:50,670
I'm hungry.

128
00:11:50,670 --> 00:11:51,130
Come on.

129
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:54,180
Careful.

130
00:11:55,430 --> 00:11:55,830
Here.

131
00:11:58,590 --> 00:11:59,470
Dig in.

132
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:03,000
Why don't you eat?

133
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:05,790
Buddy,

134
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,410
my mother once said,

135
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:08,790
difficulties will be all gone

136
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:10,760
when you fill your stomach.

137
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:14,850
If you don't eat, I will.

138
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:18,120
You can have the rest.

139
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:21,250
The vegetarian dishes here are awful.

140
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:23,880
Don't you look down on the cooks
in Tianxiang Sect.

141
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:26,120
The food for us gofers
is truly less than ideal.

142
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:26,830
But later,

143
00:12:26,830 --> 00:12:28,160
the sect will hold a banquet.

144
00:12:28,160 --> 00:12:30,040
When that happens, I'll show you

145
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:32,360
what delicacies are.

146
00:12:32,470 --> 00:12:33,360
Delicacies?

147
00:12:34,310 --> 00:12:36,240
Better save some room for them, right?

148
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,360
You wish.

149
00:12:37,430 --> 00:12:38,920
You won't even get a seat
at the main table.

150
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:39,760
I'm telling you,

151
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:40,550
all delicacies

152
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:42,310
are served to Batous only.

153
00:12:42,470 --> 00:12:44,240
We only get to watch.

154
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:44,920
Watch?

155
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:46,830
What's the fun in that?

156
00:12:46,830 --> 00:12:49,320
This showcases the brilliance
of the Sect Master.

157
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,830
When gofers see Batous enjoying

158
00:12:50,830 --> 00:12:51,590
such good stuff,

159
00:12:51,590 --> 00:12:54,590
they'll naturally try their best
to move their way up.

160
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:06,460
It's just a dinner.

161
00:13:06,790 --> 00:13:07,720
Why take a photo?

162
00:13:07,950 --> 00:13:09,760
This photo is to commemorate

163
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,830
Blind Du's downfall,

164
00:13:10,830 --> 00:13:12,070
the Qian family's defeat,

165
00:13:12,070 --> 00:13:13,600
and the fortune we raked in.

166
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:15,160
Usually, the sect

167
00:13:15,190 --> 00:13:16,430
only holds a banquet

168
00:13:16,460 --> 00:13:18,590
after accomplishing something huge.

169
00:13:32,350 --> 00:13:33,080
Let's drink.

170
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:34,590
Sure.

171
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:35,500
Come on.

172
00:13:35,550 --> 00:13:36,280
Liang.

173
00:13:37,070 --> 00:13:38,040
Tell me.

174
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,190
Who are

175
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:40,920
these people?

176
00:13:42,430 --> 00:13:43,280
Right now,

177
00:13:43,550 --> 00:13:45,620
the one drinking a toast
to the Sect Master

178
00:13:45,620 --> 00:13:47,310
is Chief Batou, Qin Baichuan.

179
00:13:46,140 --> 00:13:48,270
[Chief Batou, Qin Baichuan]

180
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:49,040
He's really nice to his subordinates.

181
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:50,120
But now, he's chief

182
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:52,070
of Muzilian Branch in Suhang.

183
00:13:52,090 --> 00:13:53,750
So he rarely stays in Yucheng.

184
00:13:54,710 --> 00:13:57,280
The man to the left of the Sect Master
is the Second Batou.

185
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:58,120
The Sect Master

186
00:13:57,570 --> 00:13:59,900
[The Second Batou, Porcelain Butcher]

187
00:13:58,160 --> 00:13:59,640
took him in when he was little.

188
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,240
Much of the sect's dirty work

189
00:14:01,430 --> 00:14:02,360
was done by him.

190
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:04,190
He's ruthless and brutal.

191
00:14:04,190 --> 00:14:05,400
Before joining the sect,

192
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:07,860
he even snatched buns
from starving people.

193
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:09,710
He gets really excited
at the sight of dead bodies.

194
00:14:09,710 --> 00:14:10,400
Currently,

195
00:14:10,500 --> 00:14:12,670
he's running a coffin shop.

196
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:13,640
Oh, right.

197
00:14:14,310 --> 00:14:15,190
There's one more thing.

198
00:14:15,190 --> 00:14:16,920
Though he never says it to anyone,

199
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:18,400
it's known to everybody

200
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:21,020
that he's very much into the Fifth Batou.

201
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,670
Yanzi.

202
00:14:25,790 --> 00:14:26,450
To the right

203
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:27,850
of the Sect Master,

204
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:28,880
the man in glasses

205
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:30,190
is the Third Batou.

206
00:14:30,190 --> 00:14:31,190
He's literate.

207
00:14:30,500 --> 00:14:33,250
[The Third Batou, Needle in Cotton]

208
00:14:31,310 --> 00:14:32,570
He smiles at everyone.

209
00:14:33,310 --> 00:14:34,950
Every time he smiles at me,

210
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,640
it gives me the creeps

211
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:38,040
and unsettles my nerves.

212
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:39,670
He's closest to the Seventh Batou,

213
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:41,040
who is seated next to him,

214
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:42,500
with a fair powdered face.

215
00:14:42,780 --> 00:14:44,030
He used to be an opera singer

216
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:45,320
[The Seventh Batou, Immortal's Hand]

217
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:45,210
playing female roles.

218
00:14:45,210 --> 00:14:46,470
He knows a bit of sleight of hand.

219
00:14:46,470 --> 00:14:47,040
So he's nicknamed

220
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:48,070
the Immortal's Hand.

221
00:14:48,070 --> 00:14:49,670
He is junior

222
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:51,250
to all the other Batous.

223
00:14:51,310 --> 00:14:53,160
But he's particularly good
at reading people's faces.

224
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:55,190
That's how he weaseled his way in
with the Third Batou.

225
00:14:55,190 --> 00:14:56,240
As for the Fourth Batou,

226
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,880
he learns from Westerners.

227
00:14:56,460 --> 00:14:58,910
[The Fourth Batou, Zhang Zizhan]

228
00:14:58,190 --> 00:14:59,760
He's of different origins from ours.

229
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:01,190
He rarely designs scams.

230
00:15:01,190 --> 00:15:02,250
But the Sect Master

231
00:15:02,310 --> 00:15:03,310
values talent,

232
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:04,670
so he keeps him close.

233
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:06,000
The woman beside him,

234
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:06,830
Huang Farong,

235
00:15:06,510 --> 00:15:08,320
[Huang Farong, from Yuehaitang Branch]

236
00:15:07,310 --> 00:15:08,270
is his wife.

237
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:10,780
She works for Yuehaitang Branch.

238
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:12,380
Then the man in sunglasses

239
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:14,620
must be the Sixth Batou, right?

240
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:17,660
[The Sixth Batou, Master Swindler]

241
00:15:14,730 --> 00:15:16,470
He's nicknamed the Master Swindler.

242
00:15:16,470 --> 00:15:19,040
I guess he's the best fighter in our sect.

243
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:20,880
Besides, he's really close

244
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:22,220
to the Sect Master.

245
00:15:22,280 --> 00:15:23,590
He's always with the Sect Master

246
00:15:23,590 --> 00:15:25,520
when the latter's out pulling scams.

247
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:27,070
Word has it in the sect

248
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,120
that he will be

249
00:15:28,190 --> 00:15:29,850
the Sect Master's successor.

250
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:32,710
He's nothing but a lackey
of the Sect Master's.

251
00:15:32,710 --> 00:15:34,440
I know you hate the Sect Master.

252
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:37,970
I don't know why
the Sect Master keeps you around,

253
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:41,950
but I'm sure you're not the first one
who attempted to kill him.

254
00:15:41,950 --> 00:15:43,160
There was a time

255
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:45,560
when the Six Batou nearly took his life.

256
00:15:45,740 --> 00:15:46,930
[Linjiang Pier]

257
00:15:46,970 --> 00:15:49,760
[Eighteen years ago]

258
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,070
He's the great master you talked about?

259
00:16:10,070 --> 00:16:10,870
Yes, exactly.

260
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:12,120
Previously, there was a severe drought.

261
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:13,160
The river stopped yielding fish.

262
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:14,470
But ever since he arrived,

263
00:16:14,470 --> 00:16:15,920
the fish have been jumping out

264
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:17,190
of the water like crazy.

265
00:16:17,190 --> 00:16:18,250
Now, the fishermen

266
00:16:18,280 --> 00:16:19,520
all rush to offer him money.

267
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:21,590
For that, we're losing our cut.

268
00:16:57,760 --> 00:16:58,520
Fish!

269
00:16:58,520 --> 00:16:59,580
Look, so many fish!

270
00:17:04,710 --> 00:17:05,599
Why do fish

271
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:07,230
obey him like that?

272
00:17:07,470 --> 00:17:08,990
The Sect Master had a secret recipe.

273
00:17:08,990 --> 00:17:11,190
He took green-shelled eggs
from silkie hens,

274
00:17:11,190 --> 00:17:13,750
marinated them with mutton
for seven days and seven nights,

275
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:16,349
then added yellow azalea
and sleeping powder,

276
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:17,710
and finally made it into fish bait.

277
00:17:17,710 --> 00:17:19,670
The fish would come
as they smelled the fishy scent.

278
00:17:19,670 --> 00:17:20,990
After taking the bait, they got drunk

279
00:17:20,990 --> 00:17:21,940
and stayed motionless,

280
00:17:21,940 --> 00:17:23,869
so people could easily catch them.

281
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:28,230
These damn frauds!

282
00:17:28,470 --> 00:17:30,530
How dare they humiliate me on my turf.

283
00:17:33,430 --> 00:17:34,750
Whoever takes him out

284
00:17:35,190 --> 00:17:36,510
can get 10 percent

285
00:17:36,670 --> 00:17:37,730
of our future cuts.

286
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:39,430
Boss,

287
00:17:39,670 --> 00:17:41,800
these people are from Tianxiang Sect.

288
00:17:41,950 --> 00:17:42,990
They are not to be trifled with.

289
00:17:42,990 --> 00:17:45,520
No one in the underworld
is to be trifled with!

290
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:48,080
Are you just going to let them
walk all over us?

291
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:48,880
Boss.

292
00:17:56,230 --> 00:17:57,560
I'll take him down.

293
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:03,190
Only those who stand shoulder to shoulder

294
00:18:03,190 --> 00:18:04,520
can be called brothers.

295
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,510
If you make it,

296
00:18:05,750 --> 00:18:07,670
I guarantee you wealth and glory.

297
00:18:07,670 --> 00:18:08,080
Sect Master,

298
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:09,080
let me handle him.

299
00:18:14,990 --> 00:18:15,990
If you die,

300
00:18:16,270 --> 00:18:18,470
I'll take care of your family.

301
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:19,950
I will treat

302
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:21,640
your mother as my own.

303
00:18:29,710 --> 00:18:32,110
If you want to kill me,
just get it over with.

304
00:18:34,710 --> 00:18:35,640
You risked your life

305
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:37,300
for a few words your boss said.

306
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:38,760
You do have some guts.

307
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:39,990
But are you sure your boss,

308
00:18:39,990 --> 00:18:41,640
the Sea Overlord, is a real man?

309
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:42,880
Don't you know the terrible things

310
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,210
he did to the villagers?

311
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:46,190
To lose your life for man like that...

312
00:18:46,190 --> 00:18:47,320
You're such a fool.

313
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:49,100
Am I supposed to believe you over him?

314
00:18:49,100 --> 00:18:50,700
You don't have to believe me.

315
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:53,840
Let me wait with you for the result.

316
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:54,640
Take him away.

317
00:19:05,150 --> 00:19:07,480
What an interesting way of holding nails.

318
00:19:08,520 --> 00:19:10,030
It's just as interesting as you are.

319
00:19:10,030 --> 00:19:10,750
You...

320
00:19:14,030 --> 00:19:14,990
The Sect Master

321
00:19:15,230 --> 00:19:16,990
locked him up for about a month.

322
00:19:17,190 --> 00:19:18,160
The Sixth Batou

323
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,750
finally calmed down.

324
00:19:19,750 --> 00:19:21,560
But when he returned home,

325
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:23,950
he found his mother had starved to death.

326
00:19:23,950 --> 00:19:26,670
Later, people started moving things
out of his house.

327
00:19:26,670 --> 00:19:28,030
Only then did he realize

328
00:19:28,230 --> 00:19:30,990
that the Sea Overlord had even
sold his house.

329
00:19:31,360 --> 00:19:33,080
It was the Sect Master who paid to hold

330
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:34,880
a proper funeral for his mother.

331
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:36,120
The Sixth Batou

332
00:19:36,190 --> 00:19:37,400
is quite a filial son.

333
00:19:37,710 --> 00:19:39,970
He visits his mother's grave every year.

334
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:41,470
Some time later,

335
00:19:41,710 --> 00:19:43,670
he killed the Sea Overlord on his own.

336
00:19:43,670 --> 00:19:45,190
Afterwards, he joined the sect

337
00:19:45,190 --> 00:19:47,030
and became loyal to the Sect Master.

338
00:19:47,030 --> 00:19:47,920
Buddy,

339
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,920
the Sect Master is actually quite nice.

340
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:51,840
He's really not what you think.

341
00:19:51,860 --> 00:19:53,870
Look, I've been in the sect for years.

342
00:19:53,870 --> 00:19:55,190
I've heard and seen

343
00:19:55,370 --> 00:19:56,540
quite a lot.

344
00:19:56,800 --> 00:20:00,060
To my knowledge, the Sect Master
has never ordered to kill.

345
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:02,160
Look at this flower.

346
00:20:02,470 --> 00:20:03,800
Pretty red, isn't it?

347
00:20:03,940 --> 00:20:07,350
But in your eyes, it looks black.

348
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:08,280
Why?

349
00:20:09,210 --> 00:20:10,560
You're only seeing

350
00:20:12,230 --> 00:20:13,880
what's on the surface.

351
00:20:15,190 --> 00:20:17,590
My own experience
must be real then, right?

352
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:21,230
I...

353
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,640
I lost all my family and then

354
00:20:24,560 --> 00:20:26,270
came to this town

355
00:20:26,510 --> 00:20:27,440
to make a living.

356
00:20:27,530 --> 00:20:27,990
You didn't slack off?

357
00:20:27,990 --> 00:20:29,400
Big Teapot!

358
00:20:30,030 --> 00:20:32,640
I poured tea for people in a teahouse.

359
00:20:33,030 --> 00:20:35,470
Everyone called me Big Teapot.

360
00:20:35,490 --> 00:20:36,950
He really looks like a big teapot.

361
00:20:36,950 --> 00:20:37,750
Sir,

362
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:39,190
sorry for the kerfuffle.

363
00:20:39,190 --> 00:20:39,790
Everyone,

364
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:40,600
my apologies.

365
00:20:40,710 --> 00:20:41,580
Enjoy yourselves.

366
00:20:41,580 --> 00:20:42,980
Take your time and enjoy.

367
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:47,190
There you are, sir.

368
00:20:52,990 --> 00:20:54,270
What happened to your face?

369
00:20:54,270 --> 00:20:55,230
Nothing.

370
00:20:55,260 --> 00:20:56,570
Put your hand down.

371
00:20:58,560 --> 00:20:59,820
Turn your face around.

372
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:05,560
You're badly hurt.

373
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,430
This time, for what?

374
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:11,320
I accidentally

375
00:21:11,430 --> 00:21:13,430
broke a customer's item yesterday.

376
00:21:13,450 --> 00:21:14,680
I deserved the beating.

377
00:21:14,680 --> 00:21:16,290
Enjoy yourself, sir.

378
00:21:16,740 --> 00:21:17,650
Wait.

379
00:21:22,840 --> 00:21:24,120
This is my address.

380
00:21:24,290 --> 00:21:26,950
If you're done with being beaten here
every day,

381
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:29,000
then come find me.

382
00:21:34,230 --> 00:21:35,190
By the way...

383
00:21:36,120 --> 00:21:37,190
Can you read?

384
00:21:38,430 --> 00:21:39,800
No, I can't.

385
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:42,440
Then have the note read to you.

386
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:48,490
Get me the check!

387
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:49,950
Yes, sir!

388
00:21:52,030 --> 00:21:53,160
Three copper coins.

389
00:21:57,310 --> 00:21:58,380
The next day,

390
00:21:58,710 --> 00:22:00,030
I made up my mind

391
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:01,950
and went to that address

392
00:22:02,100 --> 00:22:03,700
to meet with the Sect Master.

393
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:08,160
Silly Liang!

394
00:22:09,080 --> 00:22:09,880
Yes, Sect Master.

395
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:10,990
You made contributions too.

396
00:22:10,990 --> 00:22:12,030
Care to join us for a drink?

397
00:22:12,030 --> 00:22:12,600
No,

398
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:12,990
Sect Master.

399
00:22:12,990 --> 00:22:14,360
I'm not fit to sit at that table.

400
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:16,020
Enjoy yourself, Sect Master.

401
00:22:16,750 --> 00:22:17,670
What a kid.

402
00:22:19,060 --> 00:22:20,720
Oh my, that was quite a fright.

403
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:39,300
Everyone, let's call it a day.

404
00:22:41,160 --> 00:22:41,690
Let's go.

405
00:22:44,950 --> 00:22:45,880
What's going on?

406
00:22:46,190 --> 00:22:48,120
Must be those vile creatures
from the Plum Blossom Sect again.

407
00:22:48,120 --> 00:22:49,710
They've been pulling stunts
everywhere lately,

408
00:22:49,710 --> 00:22:51,710
cooking up some sort of crap miracle

409
00:22:51,730 --> 00:22:53,660
and stealing much of our business.

410
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:55,270
What miracle?

411
00:22:56,750 --> 00:22:58,810
The ascension of immortal children.

412
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:14,840
Immortal child, please get on
the heavenly ladder.

413
00:25:01,430 --> 00:25:03,420
Look, the immortal child
is ascending to the sky!

414
00:25:03,420 --> 00:25:04,930
The immortal child
is ascending to the sky!

415
00:25:04,930 --> 00:25:07,330
The immortal child
is ascending to the sky!

416
00:25:11,010 --> 00:25:14,120
Thank you, Master!

417
00:25:27,360 --> 00:25:30,080
The merits are accomplished.

418
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:32,950
You will be relieved of three sufferings.

419
00:25:32,950 --> 00:25:35,310
Blessings shall extend
to you and your kin.

420
00:25:35,310 --> 00:25:38,510
The plum blossoms open the holy path!

421
00:25:44,990 --> 00:25:45,750
Liang,

422
00:25:46,080 --> 00:25:47,610
is it really that mystical?

423
00:25:48,320 --> 00:25:50,180
Could you take me there for a look?

424
00:25:50,270 --> 00:25:50,950
No way.

425
00:25:50,950 --> 00:25:51,640
The Sect Master said

426
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:53,950
that you must stay strictly
within Tianxiang Sect.

427
00:25:53,950 --> 00:25:55,380
I know how to break up this scam.

428
00:25:55,380 --> 00:25:56,550
Come on, give it a rest.

429
00:25:56,550 --> 00:25:57,920
Even these many Batous can't figure a way.

430
00:25:57,920 --> 00:25:59,520
What makes you think you can?

431
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:00,990
Liang,

432
00:26:01,430 --> 00:26:03,430
when you first saw them
casting the ritual,

433
00:26:03,430 --> 00:26:05,800
was it around the first day
of the lunar month?

434
00:26:05,800 --> 00:26:06,560
How did you know that?

435
00:26:06,560 --> 00:26:07,600
Think about it.

436
00:26:08,080 --> 00:26:09,120
There were barely any stars

437
00:26:09,120 --> 00:26:10,720
in the sky that night, right?

438
00:26:11,430 --> 00:26:12,360
Yes, exactly.

439
00:26:12,880 --> 00:26:15,010
If we solve this difficulty, you'll be

440
00:26:15,190 --> 00:26:17,950
deemed to have made a major contribution
by the Sect Master.

441
00:26:17,950 --> 00:26:19,230
Perhaps by then,

442
00:26:19,670 --> 00:26:21,160
I'll even have to call you

443
00:26:21,540 --> 00:26:22,850
grandmaster.

444
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:40,580
I'd like to hear you say it now.

445
00:26:41,810 --> 00:26:43,300
Not before we get the job done.

446
00:26:43,300 --> 00:26:44,020
Buddy,

447
00:26:44,210 --> 00:26:45,610
thank you for helping me.

448
00:26:45,630 --> 00:26:47,130
Let me treat you to candied haws.

449
00:26:47,130 --> 00:26:47,810
One bite for me.

450
00:26:47,810 --> 00:26:48,740
One bite for you.

451
00:26:49,080 --> 00:26:49,950
If I do become a Batou

452
00:26:49,950 --> 00:26:51,080
when this is done,

453
00:26:51,080 --> 00:26:51,840
I'll treat you to meat.

454
00:26:51,840 --> 00:26:52,600
Still, one bite for me,

455
00:26:52,600 --> 00:26:53,430
and one bite for you.

456
00:26:53,430 --> 00:26:54,560
Come on, have a bite.

457
00:26:56,560 --> 00:26:59,160
One handcuff for you
and one for me as well, huh?

458
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:01,400
I have my cut, and you have yours.

459
00:27:01,730 --> 00:27:02,680
Fine then.

460
00:27:07,950 --> 00:27:09,080
The one performing the ritual

461
00:27:09,080 --> 00:27:11,940
should be Mei Xuanzi,
head of the Plum Blossom Sect.

462
00:27:50,810 --> 00:27:52,090
Behold,

463
00:27:52,190 --> 00:27:55,120
the immortal child
is to ascend the heavenly ladder.

464
00:28:39,740 --> 00:28:40,580
How insolent!

465
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:41,730
Who are you devil creature

466
00:28:41,730 --> 00:28:43,870
to stop the immortal child's ascension?

467
00:28:43,870 --> 00:28:44,790
Take him down!

468
00:28:52,200 --> 00:28:53,000
Move aside!

469
00:28:53,020 --> 00:28:53,850
Move!

470
00:29:03,160 --> 00:29:03,990
Get down here!

471
00:29:04,670 --> 00:29:05,800
Come down right now!

472
00:29:06,370 --> 00:29:07,370
Leave the ladder!

473
00:29:30,080 --> 00:29:31,740
There was a balloon attached.

474
00:29:35,190 --> 00:29:36,720
You have all been deceived.

475
00:29:37,990 --> 00:29:39,190
They drug the children

476
00:29:39,190 --> 00:29:40,510
and tie them to a balloon

477
00:29:40,510 --> 00:29:42,990
with a black thread
while they are unconscious.

478
00:29:42,990 --> 00:29:44,340
As the children climb up,

479
00:29:44,340 --> 00:29:46,120
the balloon will carry them
high in the sky

480
00:29:46,120 --> 00:29:48,180
only for them to fall to their deaths.

481
00:29:48,650 --> 00:29:50,210
My little boy!

482
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:16,990
What is this about?

483
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:19,360
We will take the money.

484
00:30:20,230 --> 00:30:21,960
By the code of this line of work,

485
00:30:22,160 --> 00:30:23,510
he who wrecks my setup

486
00:30:23,710 --> 00:30:25,240
must have his tongue cut out

487
00:30:25,470 --> 00:30:27,190
and be expelled from the sect he's in.

488
00:30:27,190 --> 00:30:28,080
Sect Master,

489
00:30:28,670 --> 00:30:31,470
will you do it, or shall my men do it?

490
00:30:32,190 --> 00:30:34,470
Master Mei, this is not right.

491
00:30:34,990 --> 00:30:36,320
Laying down rules

492
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:37,950
at my own place...

493
00:30:38,360 --> 00:30:39,840
It's inappropriate, isn't it?

494
00:30:39,840 --> 00:30:40,950
Let me tell you

495
00:30:40,950 --> 00:30:42,550
the rules of Tianxiang Sect.

496
00:30:42,950 --> 00:30:45,010
Subjecting the people to suffering,

497
00:30:45,230 --> 00:30:46,490
separating families,

498
00:30:46,710 --> 00:30:48,080
and harming children

499
00:30:48,840 --> 00:30:50,230
are not to be tolerated.

500
00:30:50,950 --> 00:30:52,010
Is this your stance

501
00:30:52,230 --> 00:30:53,830
on this matter, Sect Master?

502
00:30:54,510 --> 00:30:56,560
Today, you must hand this person over,

503
00:30:56,560 --> 00:30:58,030
or I'll turn the entire Tianxiang Sect

504
00:30:58,030 --> 00:30:59,880
upside down!

505
00:31:05,310 --> 00:31:06,520
I don't believe it.

506
00:31:09,670 --> 00:31:12,000
Let me see which of you
dares to make a move.

507
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:14,850
You.

508
00:31:19,900 --> 00:31:20,790
You.

509
00:31:25,930 --> 00:31:27,060
Who else?

510
00:31:31,750 --> 00:31:33,120
Stop playing tricks.

511
00:31:36,800 --> 00:31:38,080
And you.

512
00:31:42,360 --> 00:31:43,360
Oh, that broken chair of mine.

513
00:31:43,360 --> 00:31:44,710
It caused you to fall.

514
00:31:44,840 --> 00:31:45,880
Come on.

515
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:47,050
Get up now.

516
00:31:47,090 --> 00:31:47,980
Let me see.

517
00:31:48,270 --> 00:31:49,420
Are you alright?

518
00:31:52,030 --> 00:31:53,830
Anything else you'd like to say?

519
00:31:54,840 --> 00:31:55,880
Sect Master,

520
00:31:55,880 --> 00:31:57,800
our paths will cross again.

521
00:31:58,190 --> 00:32:00,450
We'll have plenty of time to settle this.

522
00:32:00,840 --> 00:32:03,170
Goodbye and take care.
I won't see you out.

523
00:32:21,670 --> 00:32:22,230
Sir.

524
00:32:26,180 --> 00:32:27,220
Stop watching.

525
00:32:27,510 --> 00:32:28,770
Come out here, you two.

526
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:32,920
The two of you did put on quite a show.

527
00:32:33,120 --> 00:32:35,880
The Plum Blossom Sect
has been completely humiliated.

528
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:37,160
Rescuing the innocent

529
00:32:37,600 --> 00:32:39,460
and helping families reunite...

530
00:32:39,880 --> 00:32:40,940
That's a good deed.

531
00:32:41,430 --> 00:32:42,630
You deserve rewards.

532
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:46,120
That said, in Tianxiang Sect, the code

533
00:32:46,120 --> 00:32:48,950
has always been to reward merit
and punish fault without ambiguity.

534
00:32:48,950 --> 00:32:50,320
Rewards and punishments

535
00:32:50,320 --> 00:32:51,510
will be given fairly.

536
00:32:51,510 --> 00:32:52,840
Is it correct, Silly Liang?

537
00:32:52,840 --> 00:32:53,320
Yes.

538
00:32:54,510 --> 00:32:56,320
Sect Master, I know I did wrong.

539
00:32:56,560 --> 00:32:57,470
What did you do wrong?

540
00:32:57,470 --> 00:32:58,800
I left my post without permission.

541
00:32:58,800 --> 00:33:00,060
I also took the liberty

542
00:33:00,080 --> 00:33:01,600
of letting Shangguan Chengming
out of the sect.

543
00:33:01,600 --> 00:33:03,800
I disobeyed your orders, Sect Master.

544
00:33:04,710 --> 00:33:06,470
What should we do with you then?

545
00:33:06,560 --> 00:33:07,670
You have to be punished, right?

546
00:33:07,670 --> 00:33:09,840
Sir, I'm truly sorry for what I did.

547
00:33:09,990 --> 00:33:11,360
I won't take the gold.

548
00:33:11,360 --> 00:33:13,640
I only beg you for a chance
to make things right.

549
00:33:13,640 --> 00:33:15,100
Please spare my life, sir.

550
00:33:15,190 --> 00:33:17,640
You were always eager to foil
the Plum Blossom Sect's scheme.

551
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:18,970
Liang's doing actually

552
00:33:19,030 --> 00:33:21,290
brought honor to Tianxiang Sect, right?

553
00:33:22,560 --> 00:33:23,230
Besides,

554
00:33:23,710 --> 00:33:25,640
I came back here already, didn't I?

555
00:33:25,800 --> 00:33:27,430
You do have a point.

556
00:33:28,430 --> 00:33:29,360
Tell you what?

557
00:33:29,750 --> 00:33:31,430
I'll do Chengming a favor.

558
00:33:32,270 --> 00:33:33,160
Get up, Liang.

559
00:33:34,950 --> 00:33:35,810
Thank you, sir.

560
00:33:37,950 --> 00:33:38,990
I'll also give you

561
00:33:38,990 --> 00:33:41,120
a chance to mend your ways.

562
00:33:41,750 --> 00:33:42,990
The Plum Blossom Sect

563
00:33:42,990 --> 00:33:44,670
has been in the limelight lately.

564
00:33:44,670 --> 00:33:46,400
I can't just sit back and watch.

565
00:33:46,470 --> 00:33:48,230
I plan to hold a ceremony

566
00:33:48,400 --> 00:33:49,800
and make it a big one,

567
00:33:49,800 --> 00:33:51,670
so as to let the whole world know

568
00:33:51,670 --> 00:33:53,840
that Tianxiang Sect reigns supreme.

569
00:33:54,320 --> 00:33:55,120
I now trust you

570
00:33:55,400 --> 00:33:56,260
with this task.

571
00:33:56,670 --> 00:33:57,600
Sir, I'm sorry for what I did.

572
00:33:57,600 --> 00:33:58,470
Sir,

573
00:33:58,470 --> 00:34:00,750
I-I-I am really not up for the task.

574
00:34:01,560 --> 00:34:03,690
Look at you, having no ambition at all.

575
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:05,510
It's just a ceremony, isn't it?

576
00:34:05,510 --> 00:34:06,190
Liang.

577
00:34:07,580 --> 00:34:08,380
I'll help you.

578
00:34:35,760 --> 00:34:38,070
You lot have caused
quite a stir this time.

579
00:34:38,070 --> 00:34:39,530
Those children's parents

580
00:34:39,550 --> 00:34:41,949
are now complaining to the police station.

581
00:34:48,239 --> 00:34:50,630
We will compensate those families.

582
00:34:50,760 --> 00:34:51,880
Director,

583
00:34:52,030 --> 00:34:53,630
could you please do us a favor

584
00:34:53,679 --> 00:34:54,940
and let this one slide?

585
00:34:55,760 --> 00:34:57,320
Do people in the Plum Blossom Sect

586
00:34:57,320 --> 00:34:59,110
only buy one shoe at a time?

587
00:35:00,110 --> 00:35:01,040
I got it. I got it.

588
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:02,680
It takes a group to form a gang.

589
00:35:02,680 --> 00:35:04,070
Good things should come in pairs.

590
00:35:04,070 --> 00:35:05,070
Here is

591
00:35:05,280 --> 00:35:06,430
the other shoe.

592
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:11,880
That's more like it.

593
00:35:11,880 --> 00:35:13,760
Who in Yucheng doesn't know how hard

594
00:35:13,760 --> 00:35:15,950
you've worked and how much
you've contributed, Director Fan?

595
00:35:15,950 --> 00:35:17,200
You're holding up half

596
00:35:17,200 --> 00:35:19,330
of the city by yourself, Director Fan.

597
00:35:19,800 --> 00:35:21,070
This time, Tianxiang Sect

598
00:35:21,070 --> 00:35:22,630
humiliated us in front of many

599
00:35:22,630 --> 00:35:24,320
and made us suffer a great loss.

600
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:26,070
If you could kindly help us—

601
00:35:26,070 --> 00:35:27,320
You want to get even?

602
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:30,200
Tianxiang Sect is powerful
and has many disciples.

603
00:35:30,200 --> 00:35:31,860
They are not to be messed with.

604
00:35:31,990 --> 00:35:33,320
Man schemes a thousand ways,

605
00:35:33,320 --> 00:35:34,920
but Heaven has the final say.

606
00:35:34,950 --> 00:35:36,920
From now on, 80%
of the Plum Blossom Sect's profits

607
00:35:36,920 --> 00:35:37,840
will be yours.

608
00:35:39,200 --> 00:35:39,990
Well then...

609
00:35:41,360 --> 00:35:42,440
wait to hear from me.

610
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:43,520
Sure.

611
00:35:47,070 --> 00:35:47,670
Director,

612
00:35:48,240 --> 00:35:49,900
don't forget about the stuff.

613
00:35:51,200 --> 00:35:52,400
As a public servant,

614
00:35:52,590 --> 00:35:54,400
I stay clear of gold and silver.

615
00:35:54,680 --> 00:35:56,800
You just pay for the tea today.

616
00:36:18,590 --> 00:36:19,200
Director,

617
00:36:19,200 --> 00:36:21,070
the Plum Blossom Sect case is closed.

618
00:36:21,070 --> 00:36:22,150
They'd like to offer you

619
00:36:22,150 --> 00:36:23,550
a token of appreciation.

620
00:36:29,630 --> 00:36:30,360
Is this all?

621
00:36:31,510 --> 00:36:32,770
This is all of the gift.

622
00:36:36,550 --> 00:36:38,810
I had a meeting with the superiors today.

623
00:36:38,920 --> 00:36:41,280
They want me to be
the deputy corps commander.

624
00:36:41,280 --> 00:36:43,280
I will highly recommend you to them,

625
00:36:44,550 --> 00:36:45,200
so you can

626
00:36:45,510 --> 00:36:46,770
take over my position.

627
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:47,720
Director,

628
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:50,700
please spare me all this testing.

629
00:36:50,990 --> 00:36:52,320
They're transferring you

630
00:36:52,320 --> 00:36:53,990
only to put their own people in.

631
00:36:53,990 --> 00:36:55,200
I swear to God that I've never

632
00:36:55,200 --> 00:36:57,260
thought about taking your position.

633
00:36:57,630 --> 00:36:59,400
It is my greatest blessing

634
00:37:00,030 --> 00:37:01,960
to be your subordinate all my life.

635
00:37:04,550 --> 00:37:06,950
That post of deputy corps commander
is just a figurehead.

636
00:37:06,950 --> 00:37:08,880
It sounds like a promotion in rank,

637
00:37:09,430 --> 00:37:12,240
but it comes with little real power.

638
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:14,150
But if I refuse it,

639
00:37:14,150 --> 00:37:15,950
I might not get

640
00:37:15,950 --> 00:37:17,610
a better chance in the future.

641
00:37:18,400 --> 00:37:19,530
I really have no idea

642
00:37:21,070 --> 00:37:23,720
if this is a blessing or a curse.

643
00:37:26,400 --> 00:37:27,000
Director,

644
00:37:27,590 --> 00:37:28,510
don't fret.

645
00:37:28,990 --> 00:37:31,590
How about asking a master
to tell your fortune?

646
00:37:32,280 --> 00:37:33,880
I'd love to do some divination.

647
00:37:33,880 --> 00:37:34,470
But

648
00:37:34,590 --> 00:37:36,850
there are too few real masters nowadays.

649
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:38,950
Meanwhile,

650
00:37:39,800 --> 00:37:40,840
frauds prevail.

651
00:37:41,150 --> 00:37:42,110
That's right.

652
00:37:43,920 --> 00:37:44,630
Director,

653
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:47,360
There is an amazing fortune teller
in Yucheng,

654
00:37:47,840 --> 00:37:49,770
famous throughout the southwest.

655
00:37:50,400 --> 00:37:51,320
Do you know him?

656
00:37:53,400 --> 00:37:55,400
I haven't had any dealings with him,

657
00:37:55,400 --> 00:37:56,800
but I can find him.

658
00:37:57,320 --> 00:37:59,070
If he dares to scam you...

659
00:37:59,070 --> 00:38:00,150
I'll finish him off

660
00:38:00,920 --> 00:38:02,630
before you even lift a finger.

661
00:38:05,510 --> 00:38:06,310
Alright then.

662
00:38:18,110 --> 00:38:18,590
Sir.

663
00:38:22,150 --> 00:38:22,880
How do I look?

664
00:38:23,200 --> 00:38:23,760
Great.

665
00:38:24,030 --> 00:38:25,360
They were made in America.

666
00:38:25,360 --> 00:38:25,960
So classy.

667
00:38:28,200 --> 00:38:28,760
I called for you.

668
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:29,990
What took you so long?

669
00:38:30,200 --> 00:38:31,280
I got up early

670
00:38:31,510 --> 00:38:33,040
to visit my mother's grave.

671
00:38:33,990 --> 00:38:35,030
I was too busy before

672
00:38:35,030 --> 00:38:35,950
to have time for that.

673
00:38:35,950 --> 00:38:38,430
Did you say how you've been
at your mother's grave?

674
00:38:38,430 --> 00:38:39,070
Yes, I did.

675
00:38:41,070 --> 00:38:43,150
I had you come over just to ask you

676
00:38:43,360 --> 00:38:46,110
how Shangguan Chengming is doing lately.

677
00:38:47,470 --> 00:38:48,150
You've really

678
00:38:48,150 --> 00:38:50,400
sent him on an impossible mission.

679
00:38:50,590 --> 00:38:52,030
He's not even a member of our sect.

680
00:38:52,030 --> 00:38:53,230
No one listens to him.

681
00:38:53,280 --> 00:38:54,010
That's good.

682
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:57,200
Only in this way
will he figure out his position.

683
00:38:57,200 --> 00:38:59,530
Sir, you've put a lot of thought
into this,

684
00:38:59,550 --> 00:39:00,510
but I doubt

685
00:39:00,840 --> 00:39:01,950
if this kid will

686
00:39:02,400 --> 00:39:04,060
understand your intentions.

687
00:39:04,510 --> 00:39:06,170
Let things take their course.

688
00:39:07,070 --> 00:39:07,760
Sit.

689
00:39:09,720 --> 00:39:11,250
I'd like to take this chance

690
00:39:11,360 --> 00:39:12,890
to report something to you.

691
00:39:13,110 --> 00:39:14,170
We've got a new job.

692
00:39:14,470 --> 00:39:16,030
Director Wang of the police bureau seems

693
00:39:16,030 --> 00:39:18,240
to have been given a chance at promotion.

694
00:39:18,240 --> 00:39:19,970
He would like to invite you over

695
00:39:20,150 --> 00:39:21,880
to tell his fortune, probably.

696
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:23,770
You mean Wang...

697
00:39:24,430 --> 00:39:25,290
Wang Zhicheng?

698
00:39:25,550 --> 00:39:26,070
Yes.

699
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:28,800
Haven't you always wanted to befriend him?

700
00:39:29,280 --> 00:39:31,280
I think this is a great opportunity.

701
00:39:31,360 --> 00:39:33,490
Here is all the information about him.

702
00:39:34,110 --> 00:39:35,070
Did you get this?

703
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:36,280
Fan Jialie gave it to me.

704
00:39:36,280 --> 00:39:39,280
Director Wang also had him
send the invitation to you.

705
00:39:40,400 --> 00:39:40,880
I think...

706
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:41,590
Hold on.

707
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:45,650
Something's not right.

708
00:39:46,400 --> 00:39:49,470
Shortly after we ruined
the Plum Blossom Sect's setup,

709
00:39:50,510 --> 00:39:52,280
Fan Jialie...

710
00:39:54,680 --> 00:39:55,510
Could this...

711
00:39:56,110 --> 00:39:57,430
be a trap?

712
00:39:57,990 --> 00:39:59,120
Every year, our sect

713
00:39:59,360 --> 00:40:01,220
has never been short a single cent

714
00:40:01,510 --> 00:40:02,680
of the money for Fan Jialie.

715
00:40:02,680 --> 00:40:04,410
This matter is not that simple.

716
00:40:09,840 --> 00:40:10,840
Then how about...

717
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:12,730
I turn this down?

718
00:40:16,430 --> 00:40:18,960
Why would we turn away
a business opportunity

719
00:40:19,990 --> 00:40:22,030
delivered right to our door?

720
00:40:22,810 --> 00:40:26,380
[Shunxiang Teahouse]

721
00:40:39,990 --> 00:40:41,190
You achieved success

722
00:40:41,510 --> 00:40:42,710
at 29, Director Wang.

723
00:40:42,880 --> 00:40:44,590
That was because you nearly

724
00:40:45,070 --> 00:40:46,360
lost your life at 28.

725
00:40:46,590 --> 00:40:48,800
So, surviving a great disaster actually

726
00:40:48,800 --> 00:40:50,400
brings good fortune, right?

727
00:40:52,510 --> 00:40:54,710
You are destined to be with three women.

728
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:55,590
That's true.

729
00:40:56,070 --> 00:40:56,930
I just recently

730
00:40:57,150 --> 00:40:58,200
took a third woman.

731
00:40:58,200 --> 00:40:59,260
Congratulations.

732
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:04,630
Anything wrong?

733
00:41:05,470 --> 00:41:07,990
This promotion is an obstacle
in your career.

734
00:41:07,990 --> 00:41:10,450
You might lose your official post
next year.

735
00:41:10,630 --> 00:41:12,160
Astrologically speaking,

736
00:41:12,400 --> 00:41:13,800
your prospects are vast.

737
00:41:14,240 --> 00:41:15,760
But the obstacle next year

738
00:41:18,630 --> 00:41:21,200
is likely related to feng shui.

739
00:41:21,880 --> 00:41:23,150
May I ask

740
00:41:23,920 --> 00:41:28,030
if your residence is next to
waters and trees?

741
00:41:28,590 --> 00:41:29,990
Shouldn't that be good feng shui?

742
00:41:29,990 --> 00:41:30,760
It should be.

743
00:41:30,760 --> 00:41:32,880
But I'm afraid the big trees might be

744
00:41:32,880 --> 00:41:35,680
blocking the waters
before the doors and windows.

745
00:41:36,150 --> 00:41:37,350
As the ancients said,

746
00:41:37,550 --> 00:41:39,030
a single leaf can obscure the view.

747
00:41:39,030 --> 00:41:40,470
For ordinary folks, it's no big deal

748
00:41:40,470 --> 00:41:42,800
for trees to cast their shade
on the river.

749
00:41:43,070 --> 00:41:44,110
But for you, Director Wang,

750
00:41:44,110 --> 00:41:45,800
a man with vast prospects,

751
00:41:45,990 --> 00:41:47,150
that's a hindrance.

752
00:41:47,950 --> 00:41:49,210
Don't worry, though.,

753
00:41:49,400 --> 00:41:50,760
I'll adjust the feng shui for you.

754
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:52,760
You truly are a master, sir.

755
00:42:11,110 --> 00:42:12,710
Thank you for your hard work.

756
00:42:13,880 --> 00:42:15,010
Please accept this.

757
00:42:34,030 --> 00:42:35,110
Sir,

758
00:42:36,550 --> 00:42:38,630
why don't you take the money?

759
00:42:40,030 --> 00:42:42,360
It's an honor to be of your service,
Director Wang.

760
00:42:42,360 --> 00:42:43,840
How can I take your money?

761
00:42:47,110 --> 00:42:48,070
I'm leaving.

762
00:42:50,510 --> 00:42:51,320
Guards!

763
00:43:01,020 --> 00:43:02,680
What's this supposed to mean?

764
00:43:04,430 --> 00:43:05,720
You're not much

765
00:43:06,510 --> 00:43:08,370
of a good fortune teller, are you?

766
00:43:08,640 --> 00:43:11,360
Every word you said was pure nonsense.

767
00:43:12,360 --> 00:43:12,950
Director Wang,

768
00:43:12,950 --> 00:43:14,680
he's just a charlatan,

769
00:43:14,880 --> 00:43:16,280
a big fraud!

770
00:43:16,590 --> 00:43:17,510
Take him down!

771
00:43:20,550 --> 00:43:22,630
To distinguish right from wrong is wisdom;

772
00:43:22,630 --> 00:43:24,990
to invert them is folly.

773
00:43:25,070 --> 00:43:26,950
Put it in a way I can understand.

774
00:43:27,110 --> 00:43:27,760
Fine.

775
00:43:28,750 --> 00:43:30,810
I'll do three final readings for you.

776
00:43:30,840 --> 00:43:31,630
Great then.

777
00:43:33,510 --> 00:43:35,280
Proceed right now.

778
00:43:35,550 --> 00:43:37,110
If the results turn out to be accurate,

779
00:43:37,110 --> 00:43:37,880
I'll let you go.

780
00:43:37,880 --> 00:43:38,840
But if not,

781
00:43:39,240 --> 00:43:40,240
I'll shoot you dead

782
00:43:40,240 --> 00:43:41,470
on the spot!

783
00:43:45,720 --> 00:43:47,950
[In the next episode]

784
00:43:48,070 --> 00:43:50,630
I'll deal with him sooner or later.

785
00:43:48,130 --> 00:43:50,560
[The show begins]

786
00:43:50,880 --> 00:43:52,240
He's still too young.

787
00:43:52,280 --> 00:43:54,030
How is the preparation for the ritual

788
00:43:54,030 --> 00:43:55,470
to lead the dead to rebirth going?

789
00:43:55,470 --> 00:43:58,070
Set up the alter.

790
00:43:59,630 --> 00:44:00,200
Liang,

791
00:44:00,200 --> 00:44:01,950
can we skip it today?

792
00:44:01,950 --> 00:44:04,030
It's an important task.
I must take it head on.

793
00:44:04,030 --> 00:44:05,590
I'm afraid the Plum Blossom Sect
will come mess with us.

794
00:44:05,590 --> 00:44:08,050
If you're fear death,
go home and raise pigs.

795
00:44:08,920 --> 00:44:10,120
May my son

796
00:44:10,360 --> 00:44:12,470
be healthy

797
00:44:12,630 --> 00:44:14,430
and live a life free of illness.

798
00:44:20,430 --> 00:44:21,190
Liang.

799
00:44:22,590 --> 00:44:23,400
Liang.

800
00:44:24,760 --> 00:44:25,550
No way.
